description: The gateway to Web 3.0, in a single HTML file. DEX pool radar with GoPlus contract security, Uniswap-V2 AMM and liquidity desk, perps with a live liquidation tape, bar-by-bar backtester, bring-your-own-bot runtime, Polymarket odds and local chain forking. No wallet connect, no accounts, no server, works offline.
homepage: https://dexladder.com
